|#|Condition|Conformance and limits|
|---|---|---|
|1|Byte-exact ROOT8/v2/SNT1/CP2|CONFIRMED_DESIGN: exact PACROOT8/version2, PACSNT01/PACSNI01/version1 and PACR8CP2/version2; five complete offset regions512/1536/512/64/768;40 N/B/K cases20512..28960. ROOT08 is not an alternate magic.|
