## Delimited adoption

Register only the exact T0–T6 Revision2 clause bytes and pin their already-referenced offsets map; source frontmatter/title/provenance, original Revision1, review/correction/draft/implementation artifacts are not accepted wholesale. Existing accepted files are not edited. The source's historical PROPOSED/not-accepted wording changes meaning only as to acceptance of those exact clauses in the new record; every operational/functional denial remains intact.

This task's completion means normative registration and hash verification, not implementation or operational qualification. First unresolved gate after acceptance: exact reviewed portable persistence implementation and real capacity/lifetime proof; carrier issuer/native source/signature/recovery remain separate denied integration gates. No new roadmap or architecture is created.
